:: OC Micah Corner Store Studying [nobr]

Walking into the quiet, nearly empty store. You spot Micah sitting on a stool near the register. He has a textbook laid out and is writing stuff into a notebook. You’d wager he is studying or getting some homework done. He doesn’t hear the bell that signifies your entrance, so focused on his work. However, once you begin to walk closer to him, he must catch you in the corner of his eyes as he suddenly jumps up in shock. <br>

<<set _ad to [
        {
        Name: "Player",
        State: {
            Mouth: "Smirk",
        },
    },
    {
        Name: "OC Micah",
        State: {
            Outfit: "Everyday",
            Mouth: "Frown",
            Blush: 2,
        },
    },
]>>
<<ad _ad>>


<span style="color:LightSteelBlue">“Ah!”</span> He drops the pencil he was using, <span style="color:LightSteelBlue">“Oh, <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">$Player.Name</span>… Sorry, I- I didn’t hear you come in. Le- let me know if you need anything. Haha.”</span> He laughs nervously before bending down to pick up his pencil. <span style="color:LightGreen">You smile at the cute scene.</span> <br>
<<socialChange "Micah" 1 1>>
<br>
[[End|Corner Store]]